# Phase 1

Read `.cursor/plans/phase-1.md` before Phase 1 work. Implement only the stage marked current. Do not write the next stage's code while planning it.

A component plan may add detail. It may not drop a phase exit check, reorder stages, or pull in a later-phase domain.

Do not build courses, batches, enrollments, content, exams, attendance, payments, library, notices, push delivery, file storage, analytics, Google sign-in, SMS OTP, or deployment automation. Stop and flag a task that seems to need one of these.

Student accounts have two independent paths. Self-registration via `/auth/register` logs in with no admin approval. Admin-created accounts use a one-time activation code. An account grants login only.

No actor sets, sees, or resets another user's password. Deletes are Master Admin only, enforced in the API. Use the concrete values in `docs/phases/phase-1.md` unless Shahriar says otherwise.

Where that spec says "Section 9" for tests, use Section 11.
